OL,3,GNEWSASwinney backs decriminalisation of
OL,4,Adrugs after spike in deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government, which controls drugs
OL,7,Fpolicy, would have to agree to
OL,8,Fdecriminalisation for it to be rolled
OL,9,Fout in Scotland.
